  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 tablespoons olive oil",
    "1 pound shrimp, peeled and deveined",
    "salt to taste",
    "6 cloves garlic, finely minced",
    "0.25 teaspoon red pepper flakes",
    "3 tablespoons lemon juice",
    "1 tablespoon caper brine",
    "2 tablespoons cold butter, cut into 4 equal pieces, divided",
    "0.33333334326744 cup chopped flat-leaf parsley, divided",
    "1 teaspoon water, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/u8U0hoGf5DtBvQh1XyKU0Fc482w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220597-Simple-garlic-shrimp-Step1Mise_38510-b7d6df37dfb14d97910d56e4bfa9beb1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220597/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat olive oil in a heavy skillet over high heat until it just begins to smoke. Place shrimp in an even layer on the bottom of the pan and cook for 1 minute without stirring.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0zGuxUov0Ou5ZWJHgk4ygyCBk2U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220597-Simple-garlic-shrimp-Step2_38512-88fb42d78d0a486dbc3916356b88f0e4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220597/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season shrimp with salt; cook and stir until shrimp begin to turn pink, about 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-Q6kMHXIkCk75nnh-rT-y01zScA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220597-Simple-garlic-shrimp-Step3_38513-579ab8385b944610a2aafe8432c3e9ae.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220597/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add garlic and red pepper flakes; cook and stir for 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/H3nlaEA7hW01OqQraUiVRnwH9yA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220597-Simple-garlic-shrimp-Step4_38515-a8a6238eb77e4b24a1cc6595d2040bf6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220597/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in lemon juice, caper brine, 1 piece of butter, and 1/2 of the parsley; cook until butter has melted, about 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bcbdeLJPfpQhUOr12TDTxWhcF-8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220597-Simple-garlic-shrimp-Step5_38523-791ea6a414154d86b3dcb9999b67c60f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220597/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce heat to low and stir in remaining 3 pieces butter. Cook and stir until butter has melted, sauce is thick, and shrimp are pink and opaque, 2 to 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7-WEtfeppc75MySvNaiPLYnj8ag=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220597-Simple-garlic-shrimp-Step6_38525-c830ae7ef6a3431698cce0f1456cce9e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220597/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove shrimp with a slotted spoon and transfer to a bowl; continue to cook butter sauce, adding water, 1 teaspoon at a time, if too thick, about 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uXHHLEcJUSyinOB7UCk6Tr43YAg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220597-Simple-garlic-shrimp-Step7_38527-55ee4f172bca43269811a1c4b9d519d9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220597/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season with salt to taste; serve shrimp topped with the pan sauce and remaining parsley. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/us00EX6PHgu4Dwfq9xfH6SyliA0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220597-Simple-garlic-shrimp-beauty3x4_38539-63f687e1ec6a41e88dfb5a9c9021e194.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220597/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
